cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use oxiroot in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "oxiroot: pure-Rust IO for the CERN ROOT file format"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ouillon
    given-names: Mathieu
abstract: >-
  oxiroot reads and writes CERN ROOT files in pure Rust, with no C++ or Python
  dependency: TTree and RNTuple datasets, histograms, profiles, graphs and
  functions, checked both ways against ROOT C++ and uproot. It is the ROOT-file
  crate of the oxihep family of high-energy-physics crates.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/oxihep/oxiroot"
url: "https://oxihep.github.io/oxiroot/"
keywords:
  - high-energy physics
  - CERN ROOT
  - RNTuple
  - TTree
  - Rust
version: 0.12.0
date-released: "2026-11-23"
